      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_11",
      "hash64": "87425FF65FFC6D82",
      "text": "Creo que me hace falta seguir evolucionando...[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_12",
      "hash64": "87425EF65FFC6BCF",
      "text": "¡Mi más sincera enhorabuena!\\c\\nToma esta Medalla de Gimnasio como prueba de\\ntu victoria.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_16",
      "hash64": "87425AF65FFC6503",
      "text": "También te voy a dar estos cupcakes caseros\\nmarca de la casa. ¡Disfrútalos![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_badge",
      "hash64": "03E0CD0DB4E5B087",
      "text": "Ahora que tienes [VAR 0x0200(0001)] Medalla[VAR 0x1101(0001,0100)]s de Gimnasio, los\\nPokémon de hasta Nv. [VAR 0x0201(0002)] te resultarán más\\r\\nfáciles de capturar y obedecerán tus órdenes.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
